                                "example_id": "0eabdba9-4ba0-4280-846a-ae3472af07d0",
                                "sense_id": "59d8ad96-7ba0-3e90-a2e0-ea411007211b",
                                "text": "Den he drap right ter de yerth, en I des stop long enough ter put a tin bucket on my haid 'fo' I began ter crawl atter Marse Dan."
